Derived token-frequency fingerprint for prose prediction, built from our own
generated dev + AI-prompt corpora and cleaned public-domain IETF RFC prose; profane
tokens are dropped at build via the blocklist. Contains frequencies, not verbatim
source text. See prose_en_v1.provenance.txt and SEED_ATTRIBUTION.md.
